title: "gbtag: agent identity as a forgeable greenbeard in an evolutionary AI race"
abstract: >-
  Evolutionary dynamics of badge-conditioned trust in a reduced AI race.
  A seat carries an identity badge that is verifiable but forgeable and
  conditions its conduct on the badge its opponent presents.
